  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with this Custom Football Bedding Set from Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and teams, this bedding set features a cool footballer design running with a ball. With customization options to add your own name and number, it makes a thoughtful and unique sports gift for boys, teens, or any dedicated football enthusiast in your life.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features 2 custom text inputs to add your own personalized name and number for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric that is soft, breathable, lightweight, and durable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover with a hidden zipper closure or a cozy, all-in-one comforter filled with premium microfiber to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Craftsmanship:</strong> Environmental protection printing techniques ensure vibrant colors that hold dye and prevent fading, with fine stitching along the edges.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly fits a variety of beds including US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and optional matching pillowcases or flat sheet cover.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Cool Footballer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Yes (Name &amp; Number)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
